This is an intentionally empty placeholder file.

It exists so Nextflow processes can accept an "optional" path input using the standard
nf-core NO_FILE sentinel pattern: when a real file (e.g. params.interval_list) isn't set,
the workflow feeds this file in its place, and process scripts check
`if (some_input.name != 'NO_FILE')` to decide whether to include the corresponding CLI flag
(e.g. `-L`). See workflows/somatic.nf and modules/contamination.nf / modules/mutect2.nf.
Do not delete -- several Phase 2 processes reference this exact path.
